### The rest of the 2024 cohort

The 48 properties above only cover 2024 permits whose completed buildings the 2026 assessment has caught up with. The remaining matched permits, 67 of them, are either still under construction or finished too late in 2025 for the assessment to reflect. Their 2026 assessed values still tell us something: whatever value the construction had reached, a *partial* uplift. @tbl-2024-actual-total combines both groups into a single, fully-observed total for the 2024 permit year, no rule required.


::: {#tbl-2024-actual-total .cell tbl-cap='Actual (not model-based) 2024 cohort assessed value uplift, split by completion status'}
::: {.cell-output-display}

